# MintPay

MintPay is a mobile-first fintech wallet and cashback web app concept built with React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Lucide icons, and Sonner notifications.

## Features

- Mobile-first fintech dashboard with a green wallet theme
- Login and sign-up flow with phone number + password
- Home, payment, withdrawal, statistics, account, and admin screens
- Deposit payout flows with cashback reward simulation
- Withdrawal logic and wallet balance summary
- Responsive bottom navigation shell

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open the local Vite URL shown in the terminal.

## Tech stack

- React
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Lucide-react
- Sonner
- React Router
